<style>
body { margin:0; background:var(--scene-canvas); color:var(--scene-text); font:16px system-ui; } main { max-width:800px; margin:auto; padding:16px; } h1 { font-size:24px; } a { color:var(--scene-primaryText); } canvas { width:100%; height:260px; display:block; background:var(--scene-panel); } button { min-height:48px; padding:12px; background:var(--scene-panel); color:inherit; border:1px solid var(--scene-panelBorder); border-radius:8px; font:inherit; } .pedals { display:flex; gap:12px; position:sticky; bottom:0; background:var(--scene-canvas); padding:12px 0; } .pedals button { flex:1; touch-action:none; user-select:none; } .held { outline:2px solid var(--scene-primary); } #metrics, #annotation { font:14px monospace; white-space:pre-line; min-height:80px; } [hidden] { display:none!important; }
.drive-bar {display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--scene-panel-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--scene-panel)} .drive-bar small {display:block;}
</style></head><body><main>
<header class="drive-bar"><div><strong>Downhill approach</strong><small>Next · signal and crosswalk</small></div><a href="{{ '/sf/?modes=1' | url }}">Modes</a></header>
<h1>Downhill following practice</h1>
<p>Authored 6% downhill, one lane and one scripted lead car. Simulation only; no real-world accuracy claim. Steering is locked for this exercise.</p>
<p>Start at 10 m/s. Green → amber at 3s → red at 6s; the lead clears on green, then brakes at 6s. Brake early, leave space, stop before the white limit line. The striped crosswalk starts 8m beyond it.</p>
<button id="start">Start / restart</button>
<canvas id="approach" aria-label="Top-down authored approach, player and lead car, limit line and crosswalk"></canvas>
<p id="metrics" aria-live="off">Ready. Press Start.</p>
<div class="pedals"><button data-act="brake">Brake (Space / ↓)</button><button data-act="up">Accelerate (↑)</button></div>
<button id="replay" hidden>Replay first braking event</button><button id="closeReplay" hidden>Close replay</button>
<p id="annotation" aria-live="polite"></p>
<p>Replay is offered only at rest and closes on movement. Keep braking to hold on the hill. Contact ends the attempt; restart to try again. No comfort or speed score.</p>
<script type="module" src="{{ (modulesBase + '/js/sf-following-view.js') | url }}"></script>
</main></body></html>
